  "body": "Positioned in one of the North Shore’s most desirable seaside suburbs, these brand-new architecturally designed homes at 2A, 2B and 2E Rangitoto Terrace, Milford offer modern luxury, spacious layouts, and an exceptional lifestyle just moments from the beach and Milford village. Designed with quality finishes and thoughtful layouts, these homes provide the perfect balance of comfort, style, and convenience in a highly sought-after location.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n• Brand new architecturally designed homes\r\n• 4 spacious bedrooms with multiple bathrooms\r\n• Generous floor areas approximately 162–209m²\r\n• Open-plan living with modern kitchen and quality finishes\r\n• Internal access garage (double garage for selected homes)\r\n• Elevator feature in 2B Rangitoto Terrace\r\n• Elevated positions with beautiful sea views from selected residences\r\n• Zoned for Westlake Boys’ High School, Westlake Girls’ High School, and Milford Primary School\r\n• Easy walk to Milford Beach, cafes, and shopping\r\n\r\nThese homes offer exceptional flexibility for families and professionals alike, with spacious multi-level layouts designed for comfortable living and entertaining. Located just a short stroll from Milford Beach and the vibrant Milford shopping village, residents will enjoy the perfect combination of coastal lifestyle and everyday convenience, with easy access to motorway connections, North Shore Hospital, and public transport for effortless commuting.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure brand-new homes in this premium Milford neighbourhood are rare. Contact Annie Xu today to arrange a viewing.",
